      "side": 1,
      "message": "oemVendorIanaFieldType is the same as PLDM_OEM_FRU_FIELD_TYPE_IANA right, we can reuse that.\n\nAlso I notice that some part of the code are similar in both #ifdef OEM-IBM and #else part. Can we bring those to the common part of the code so we have less duplication of code?",
